<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="topbar"><view><view class="brand">风里有约</view><view class="brand-sub">CREATE A ROUTE</view></view></view><view class="page-title">创建一条路线</view><view class="page-copy">先为自己生成，也可以整理成一条公开方案给别人采用。</view><view class="form-card"><view class="form-title">你想怎么创建？</view><button class="option-row {{mode==='ai'?'selected':''}}" data-mode="ai" bindtap="choose"><view><view class="option-title">✦ AI 私人路线</view><text class="option-sub">输入一点想法，默认只对你自己可见</text></view><text>›</text></button><button class="option-row {{mode==='publish'?'selected':''}}" data-mode="publish" bindtap="choose"><view><view class="option-title">⌁ 公开路线方案</view><text class="option-sub">整理一条你愿意分享的北京周末方案</text></view><text>›</text></button></view><view class="form-card"><view class="form-title">{{mode==='ai'?'今天想做点什么？':'把这条路线介绍给别人'}}</view><view class="form-help">{{mode==='ai'?'例如：周日下午从望京出发，一个人，想晒晒太阳，但不想太累。':'说明适合什么人、时长、预算与停留点。'}}</view><textarea class="field-textarea" placeholder="写下一点想法…" value="{{idea}}" bindinput="input"/><view wx:if="{{mode==='publish'}}" class="budget-row"><button class="chip {{kind==='place'?'active':''}}" data-type="kind" data-value="place" bindtap="pick">地点安排</button><button class="chip {{kind==='idea'?'active':''}}" data-type="kind" data-value="idea" bindtap="pick">灵感路线</button></view><button class="primary-btn create-submit" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{mode==='ai'?'生成一条我的周末路线':'继续编辑公开路线'}}</button></view><view class="privacy-note">你的原始想法和私密记录不会自动公开。每次分享、邀约都由你主动决定。</view></view>